<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Software and project terms</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Before paid work begins.</h1><p class="lede fade">An inquiry is a starting point. A product or project agreement sets the commitments.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">What this website offers</a><a href="#section-1">Custom development</a><a href="#section-2">Billing, cancellation and refunds</a><a href="#section-3">Software access and use</a><a href="#section-4">Client personal information</a><a href="#section-5">Support and service commitments</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>What this website offers</h2><p>This website presents Velani’s work and how to contact us. It does not sell a subscription, take payment, ship physical goods or guarantee a demo appointment. NEVORA is available to businesses by quote.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>Custom development</h2><p>A written engagement defines scope, deliverables, fees, milestones, acceptance, change requests, responsibilities, confidentiality, ownership and licensing, data processing, support and termination. We agree those commitments for the project; a landing page does not set them.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Billing, cancellation and refunds</h2><p>These depend on the product or signed engagement and on applicable law. This website has no checkout and sells nothing directly. Before any purchase, we set out the price, renewal, cancellation and refund terms in writing.</p></section><section id="section-3"><i>04</i><h2>Software access and use</h2><p>Software access has its own license or service terms, account lifecycle information and product privacy notices; for NEVORA they are the NEVORA terms of use and privacy policy. Using the company website creates no product access.</p></section><section id="section-4"><i>05</i><h2>Client personal information</h2><p>When a project requires processing personal information, we and the client agree the roles, purposes, recipients, security, transfer and deletion responsibilities, including a data-processing agreement where one applies.</p></section><section id="section-5"><i>06</i><h2>Support and service commitments</h2><p>Support coverage, maintenance, service levels and response expectations belong in the applicable agreement. This website creates no uptime, certification, delivery deadline or support guarantee.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
